&& L1 CENSUS -- how many LIVE HEADS does the production catalog hold TODAY?
&& AIF-078 lifecycle lane, step L1's prerequisite.
&&
&& READ-ONLY. Opens the production catalog and counts. Writes nothing.
&& It does NOT retire anything: L1 is report-only until the owner authorizes it.
&&
&& The thirteen live heads named in the plan were measured 2026-08-24 and
&& several REGRESSION ALL runs have happened since, so that list is stale by
&& construction. This asks the engine rather than trusting the old number.
&&
&& SET DELETED is ON by default, so delete-flagged rows are already hidden and
&& these counts are over the rows a user can see.

ECHO === total visible rows ===
USE D:\code\ccode\dottalkpp\data\workspaces\WORKSPACES.dbf
COUNT

ECHO === superseded (retired history) ===
COUNT FOR SUPERSEDED = "1"

ECHO === LIVE HEADS -- the number that matters for L1 ===
COUNT FOR SUPERSEDED <> "1"

ECHO === the live heads by name ===
LIST ALL FOR SUPERSEDED <> "1"

ECHO === same set, unlimited, so the 21st is not hidden by the row cap ===
LIST ALL FOR SUPERSEDED = "0"

ECHO === highest WS_ID in the catalog (allocation high-water) ===
GO BOTTOM
? WS_ID
